              "CTAImageAltText": "Wallena (Lena) Gould headshot",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 28 2024 13:58:28 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/curatedcta",
              "CTAButtonColor": "rgba(76,125,122,1)",
              "CTAImageFileReference": "/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/news/2024-ana-innovation-award-winners/wallena-lena-gould_headshot_1200x680.jpg"
            },
            "text_copy": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 28 2024 12:52:30 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<h3>Lena Gould wins ANA Nurse-Led Team Innovation Award</h3>\n<p>Lena Gould, EdD, CRNA, FAANA, FAAN, is the Founder and CEO of The Diversity in Nurse Anesthesia Mentorship Program, a 501(c)(3) non-profit organization dedicated to promoting and advancing diversity within graduate nurse anesthesia programs.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://author-stryker-prod.adobecqms.net/content/stryker/us/en/acute-care/news/ana-nurse-led-team-innovation-award.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn more</span></a></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 28 2024 13:47:11 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          },
          "col2": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
            "curatedcta_copy": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
              "CTAOpenInNewTab": "true",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
              "ctaLinkType": "none",
              "ctaOpenInNewTabOverride": "0",
              "jcr:created": "Tue Mar 05 2024 16:42:21 GMT+0000",
              "CTAImageAltText": "Kwamane Liddell headshot",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 28 2024 13:58:34 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/curatedcta",
              "CTAButtonColor": "rgba(76,125,122,1)",
              "CTAImageFileReference": "/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/news/2024-ana-innovation-award-winners/liddel-kwamane_headshot_1200x680.jpg"
            },
            "text": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 28 2024 12:52:30 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<h3>Kwamane Liddell wins ANA Innovation award</h3>\n<p>Kwamane Liddell, JD, MHA, BSN is the founder and CEO of ThriveLink, a company that uses a voice-activated AI tool to enable people to enroll directly into social and clinical programs like drug discount programs, health insurance, utility assistance, food assistance and more.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://author-stryker-prod.adobecqms.net/content/stryker/us/en/acute-care/news/kwamane-liddell-wins-ana-innovation-award.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn more</span></a></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 28 2024 13:45:08 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          },
          "col3": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
            "curatedcta_copy": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
              "CTAOpenInNewTab": "true",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
              "ctaLinkType": "none",
              "ctaOpenInNewTabOverride": "0",
              "jcr:created": "Tue Mar 05 2024 16:42:21 GMT+0000",
              "CTAImageAltText": "nurse with around around doctor, both smiling",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 28 2024 13:41:59 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/curatedcta",
              "CTAButtonColor": "rgba(76,125,122,1)",
              "CTAImageFileReference": "/content/dam/stryker/acute-care/news/nurse-led-innovation-and-the-power-of-partnership/ac-news-article-hero_nurse-led-innovation_1200x680.jpg"
            },
            "text_copy": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "jcr:createdBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-f123ca2978@example.invalid",
              "jcr:created": "Wed Aug 28 2024 12:52:30 GMT+0000",
              "text": "<h3>Nurse led innovation and the power of partnership</h3>\n<p>For both of this year’s ANA innovation award winners, innovation began with an observation that elements of quality – health equity, in particular – were broken or absent. Each innovation was carried out by way of an unwavering belief and determination that a better way is possible.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://author-stryker-prod.adobecqms.net/content/stryker/us/en/acute-care/news/kwamane-liddell-wins-ana-innovation-award.html\"><span class=\"standalone-link\">Learn more</span></a></p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Aug 28 2024 13:46:07 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          },
          "col4": {
            "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
            "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
